    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/82e150ace0759ae91b3897fa4db725ba.poster.avif?t=1745002893\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/82e150ace0759ae91b3897fa4db725ba.webm?t=1745002893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/82e150ace0759ae91b3897fa4db725ba.mp4?t=1745002893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PlanetX</strong> is a <strong>real-time strategy MMO</strong> that redefines large-scale multiplayer warfare. The battle begins on <strong>Planet Alpha</strong>, where <strong>dozens of players</strong> start with <strong>seven land plots</strong> each. Unlike traditional flat maps, the entire game takes place on a <strong>fully spherical planet</strong>, adding an extra layer of strategy to territorial expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/ceed1428f9463a035aa8ff4932beb21e.avif?t=1745002893\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>build and expand their empire</strong>, constructing various structures and managing resources. The first challenge is achieving a <strong>perfect balance between resource extraction and production</strong> to fuel economic growth. Once a player amasses enough wealth, it's time to <strong>assemble a powerful army</strong>, featuring <strong>tanks, aircraft, and missiles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/291362a3e6c6f9c90fc0a4183cb6ce87.avif?t=1745002893\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique aspect of <strong>PlanetX</strong> is its <strong>energy-based warfare\u00a0</strong>- tanks and aircraft are fully <strong>electric</strong>, requiring <strong>charging stations</strong> before heading into battle. Units will fight until they <strong>run out of energy or are destroyed</strong>, making strategic deployment and resource management crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/7c34afb1a6e54e54e8c4012063ff4b36.avif?t=1745002893\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal? <strong>Total planetary domination.</strong> The first player to conquer <strong>every available land plot</strong> on Planet Alpha <strong>claims victory</strong> and earns a <strong>ticket to Planet Beta</strong>, where even greater challenges await. As multiple Alpha champions arrive on Beta, the war escalates to an entirely new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in <strong>PlanetX\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0<strong>construction, battles, resource trading, and land deals - happens in real time</strong>, ensuring a fast-paced, dynamic experience. <strong>Do you have what it takes to rise as the supreme ruler of the galaxy?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/82e150ace0759ae91b3897fa4db725ba.poster.avif?t=1745002893\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/82e150ace0759ae91b3897fa4db725ba.webm?t=1745002893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/82e150ace0759ae91b3897fa4db725ba.mp4?t=1745002893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PlanetX</strong> is a <strong>real-time strategy MMO</strong> that redefines large-scale multiplayer warfare. The battle begins on <strong>Planet Alpha</strong>, where <strong>dozens of players</strong> start with <strong>seven land plots</strong> each. Unlike traditional flat maps, the entire game takes place on a <strong>fully spherical planet</strong>, adding an extra layer of strategy to territorial expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/ceed1428f9463a035aa8ff4932beb21e.avif?t=1745002893\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>build and expand their empire</strong>, constructing various structures and managing resources. The first challenge is achieving a <strong>perfect balance between resource extraction and production</strong> to fuel economic growth. Once a player amasses enough wealth, it's time to <strong>assemble a powerful army</strong>, featuring <strong>tanks, aircraft, and missiles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/291362a3e6c6f9c90fc0a4183cb6ce87.avif?t=1745002893\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique aspect of <strong>PlanetX</strong> is its <strong>energy-based warfare\u00a0</strong>- tanks and aircraft are fully <strong>electric</strong>, requiring <strong>charging stations</strong> before heading into battle. Units will fight until they <strong>run out of energy or are destroyed</strong>, making strategic deployment and resource management crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309950/extras/7c34afb1a6e54e54e8c4012063ff4b36.avif?t=1745002893\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal? <strong>Total planetary domination.</strong> The first player to conquer <strong>every available land plot</strong> on Planet Alpha <strong>claims victory</strong> and earns a <strong>ticket to Planet Beta</strong>, where even greater challenges await. As multiple Alpha champions arrive on Beta, the war escalates to an entirely new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in <strong>PlanetX\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0<strong>construction, battles, resource trading, and land deals - happens in real time</strong>, ensuring a fast-paced, dynamic experience. <strong>Do you have what it takes to rise as the supreme ruler of the galaxy?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "PlanetX is a real-time strategy MMO set on a spherical planet. Players expand territories, construct buildings, and manage resources to develop their empire. The ultimate goal is to conquer the entire planet by claiming all land plots and outpacing rivals in strategic growth and domination.",
